{"articleNo":"2188","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2188&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Hot) 전공별취업캠프 참가자 모집 (2012년형 SSAT 특별강의 진행)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.12.14","hit":"8837","attachments":[{"name":"전공별취업캠프참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2188&attachNo=69602"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"style3\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong><font size=\"4\">특별한 취업경쟁력 만들기</font></strong> </font></font><font color=\"#ff00ff\" size=\"5\"><strong>1박2일 프로젝트<br></strong></font><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"6\"><strong>전공별취업캠프 참가신청 접수<br></strong></font><font color=\"#666666\" size=\"2\"><font face=\"Comic Sans MS\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\" size=\"4\"><strong>&nbsp;<font color=\"#993366\">&nbsp; 2011년 마지막 취업캠프 !!&nbsp; 놓치지 마세요</font></strong></font><br><br></font><br>1. 캠프일정: 2011.12.22(목) - 12.23(금) 1박2일<br><br>2. 참가마감: <strong>2011.12.20(화)까지<br></strong><br>3. 참가신청 : <font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>참가신청서 다운받아 작성후&nbsp;취업정보센터로 제출<br></strong></font><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>1) 이메일접수&nbsp; &nbsp;job@kumoh.ac.kr<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 취업정보센터(도서관210호)로 직접방문접수<br></strong></font><br>4. 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소: 백송스파비스관광호텔(경북 군위)<br><br>5. 참가대상: 학부&nbsp;재학생 </font><font color=\"#ff0000\" size=\"2\">(선착순 80명)<br><br></font><font color=\"#666666\" size=\"2\">6. 취업캠프 교육내용<strong>(전공중심으로 1:1맞춤컨설팅)&nbsp;<br></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 취업성공전략<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 입사서류작성 및 컨설팅<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\">삼성그룹 SSAT (2012년형 SSAT)&nbsp;<br></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 취업이미지메이킹<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 면접특강<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 실전면접 및 대응법<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 교육총평<br><br>7. 교육비용 : 전액 학교부담<br><br>8. 문의: 478-7212<br><br><br></font><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">전년도 취업센터 취업캠프참가자 80%가 취업성공!<br>전공중심의 특화된 1박2일 취업캠프에 참가하여 <br>자신의&nbsp;취업역량을 강화하여 경쟁력 우위를 확보하시기 바랍니다.<br>취업준비가 미흡한 후배님들은 이번 기회를 절대 놓치지마시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>2011. 12.&nbsp;14<br></strong></font></font><font size=\"5\"><br><font color=\"#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\"><strong>취&nbsp; 업&nbsp;&nbsp;정 &nbsp;보 &nbsp;센 &nbsp;터</strong></font></span><font color=\"#666666\"> </font><font size=\"5\"><br><br></font>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
